'''Grey Matter''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Galvan (Classic)|Galvan]]<ref>[[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]</ref><ref name="SOTO"/> from the planet [[Galvan Prime (Classic)|Galvan Prime]].<ref>[[w:c:secretsaturdays:Arthur_Beeman|Arthur Beeman]]</ref><ref>[[w:c:secretsaturdays:Guess_Who%27s_Going_To_Be_Dinner|Guess Who's Going To Be Dinner]]</ref>{{Refn|[[:File:Grey Matter Bandai Lenticular Card.png]]|group = Bandai|name = Spelling}}

==Appearance==
===Ben as Grey Matter===
Grey Matter is a grey-skinned, frog-like, bipedal alien that is only six inches tall<ref>[[Howell Wainwright]]</ref><ref name="ASP"/> with large green eyes, which have rectangular pupils and horizontal eyelids.

In the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', Grey Matter wore a white jumpsuit with a thin vertical black stripe down the front, his eyes were yellowish-green, his forehead had a larger version of the jumpsuit's stripe, and the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]] symbol was on his back.

In the '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' [[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)/Theme Song|intro]], Grey Matter looked exactly the same as before, except his skin was slightly lighter, his eyes were green and he wore the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Grey Matter now has a green jumpsuit with a black belt. His suit collar is now black, and the stripe on his head and jumpsuit are no longer present. He wears black, fingerless gloves with a green rectangle on the back. His neck is slightly longer, and his [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol has returned to his back.

11-year-old Grey Matter in '''Omniverse''' looks exactly the same as he did in the '''Original Series''' except his collar is black, his eyes are green, and his skin tone is slightly different.

===Gwen as Grey Matter===
[[Gwen Tennyson (Gwen 10)|Gwen]] as Grey Matter had Gwen's hair and more oval-shaped eyes, with much smaller pupils. She wore a light blue jumpsuit with dark blue sleeves, and the Omnitrix symbol was on her back. She lacked the stripes [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s Grey Matter has.

===Ken as Grey Matter===
[[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Ken]]'s Grey Matter looked the same as 10-year-old Grey Matter in the '''Original Series'''.

