==Etymology==
Grey Matter is named after [[Wikipedia:Grey matter|grey matter]], one of the components of the central nervous system.

==Trivia==
*Grey Matter is the second smallest alien in [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben's]] arsenal; the overall smallest being [[Nanomech]].<ref>''[[The Ultimate Heist]]''</ref>
**Grey Matter is stated to be about 6 inches (15.24 cm) tall.<ref name="ASP" />
*A running gag in the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''' was that Ben turned into Grey Matter unintentionally in situations where his small size would be disadvantageous.
*When Grey Matter gets surprised, his rectangular pupils turn into very large squares.
*Grey Matter, [[Juryrigg]], and [[Feedback]] are the only aliens with their own theme song.
*Grey Matter is the first alien to stay in a whole episode due to an [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] malfunction; the second being [[Rath (Classic)|Rath]].
*Grey Matter was the first alien used by [[Ben Tennyson (No Watch Timeline)|No Watch Ben]].
*Grey Matter is [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s smartest alien.{{Refn|[[:File:Grey Matter Is Ben's Smartest Alien.PNG]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's Favorite Alien.PNG]]|group = DJW|name = derrickfav}}
*Grey Matter's DNA was the first DNA sample added to the Omnitrix.{{Refn|[[:File:Galvans First in the Omnitrix.png]]|group = DJW}} However, it came from neither [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] nor [[Albedo]].{{Refn|''link unavailable''|group = DJW}}
*Ben named Grey Matter while transformed as him.{{Refn|[[:File:When Ben Named Grey Matter.png]]|group = DR}}
*11-year-old Grey Matter was not necessarily planned to appear in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' flashbacks.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Young Ben Aliens From Intro.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Grey Matter was first envisioned by [[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)/Early Development#Greymatter|Steve E. Gordon]] as a stereotypical [[Area 51]] [[wikipedia:Grey alien|grey alien]], with a huge head and giant pupil-less eyes, wearing a black full-body latex suit that covers everything up to his chest. [[Dave Johnson]] initially designed him similar to that design, but since the concept was deemed to be scary for kids, Dave decided to go with a frog-like design instead.
**Grey Matter's '''Omniverse''' design was made by [[Derrick J. Wyatt]].{{Refn|[[:File:DJW Designed OV Grey Matter.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Some of the Aliens Designed by Derrick in OV.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Grey Matter is Derrick's favorite [[Omnitrix]] alien,{{Refn|group = DJW|name = derrickfav}} and one of [[Duncan Rouleau]]'s favorite aliens.{{Refn|https://youtu.be/IzdAJuPoKnU|group = DR}}

